      "content": "wait, hold on. i can't use that version. i'm a municipal assistant, i'm supposed to be neutral. i can't \"strongly urge\" anyone to vote a certain way or say the benefits are \"undeniable\" when half the town is protesting this. \n\ncan you rewrite it so it doesn't sound like you're taking a side? just keep it informative so people know what's happening without us sounding like we've already made up our minds.",
